B.OW=new A.aS("course-L1W6-gen-recall-p1","**Phase 1: Inside** \u2014 can you call your dog to you from anywhere in your home?")
B.Of=new A.aS("course-L1W6-gen-recall-p2","**Phase 2:** Can all family members do the same?")
B.OF=new A.aS("course-L1W6-gen-recall-p3","**Phase 3:** Can you call your dog away from the door when the mail comes?")
